     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Hey ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "accessLevel": "",
           "id": "60785e2552404d0070bf1d34",
           "text": "@Danny Bernstein"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": " I was looking through old tickets with the Fedora 6.0.0 fix version and there seems to be some around consolidating the configuration properties. Specifically ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-2434#icft=FCREPO-2434"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": " and FCREPO-2421. I was wondering if this was a general documentation around the new configuration properties file or (if not) whether there was a ticket you were aware of.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
