      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Hey <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" data-account-id=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" accountid=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Danny Bernstein</a> I was looking through old tickets with the Fedora 6.0.0 fix version and there seems to be some around consolidating the configuration properties. Specifically \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-2434\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-2434\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Consolidate System Property configuration\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10300?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-2434\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n and \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-2421\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-2421\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Document recommended credential configuration practices\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10300?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-2421\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n. I was wondering if this was a general documentation around the new configuration properties file or (if not) whether there was a ticket you were aware of.</p>",
     "created": "12/Nov/20 2:03 PM",
